{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And they had no sons.</b> Rabbi Yaakov bar Avin said in the name of Rabbi Acha: had they had sons, they would have taken precedence over Elazar and Itamar, for whoever takes precedence in inheritance takes precedence in honor, provided he conducts himself according to the custom of his ancestors." "<b>Before Aaron their father.</b> In place of their father, as in ״before the face of the hated one״, ״the firstborn shall not be yours״, ״no other Elohim before My face״."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:19.095685242Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}